bio = "A Curry Village pool attendant living in Huff. Strings up the colored dance lights between pine trunks when the crew heads out at night."
idle_lines = PackedStringArray("I rigged three battery dance lights on a broomstick. Wait till you see them bouncing off the granite in the dark.", "You can always tell a Huff tent by the climbing shoes drying on the steps and the headlamp clipped to the roof pole.", "After ten we take the party off-trail. Follow the colored glow through the trees.", "Nothing beats cold river water in the afternoon and a secret forest dance floor at midnight.")
